script = ExtResource("1_buff")
icon = ExtResource("2_icon")
; IT SETS NOTHING AT ALL, AND THAT IS COMPLETE. A pure marker: the aura reads it through
; requires_buff (passive_aura.gd:40-42) and Task 8's reaction reads it through
; UnitCondition.has_buff, and neither wants a channel, a trigger or a lifetime other than MANUAL.
; buff_shimmering_shield.tres and buff_gather_round.tres in this mod are the same file.
;
; NO `until` LINE: "until the end of the scene" is Lancer.UNTIL.MANUAL, which is the enum's own zero,
; so writing it would be writing the default.
;
; VISIBLE, per ruling 14 - it is the only thing on the board that says the dome is up. Its `icon` is
; SP5's, which is why test_every_visible_buff_has_a_real_icon carries a second failing assert from
; this task on.
